## Completion checks

- [ ] Compare the selected equilibrium quantity and mass balance with independent evidence. Identify missing inputs and out-of-range conditions in the result.
- [ ] Publish this method’s version, covered inputs and conditions, independent reference, error and resource bounds. Replay cancellation, quota and affected desktop behavior for this method.

